function refreshReceivableCategories(mainCategory='',mainSubcategory='',paymentCategory='',paymentSubcategory=''){const treatment=$('receivableTreatment')?.value||'reimbursement',paymentTreatment=$('receivablePaymentTreatment')?.value||'reimbursement';if($('receivableCategory')){const old=mainCategory||$('receivableCategory').value;$('receivableCategory').innerHTML=categoryOptionsFor(treatment==='income'?['income']:['expense','investment'],'Selecciona categoría');$('receivableCategory').value=[...$('receivableCategory').options].some(o=>o.value===old)?old:'';fillSubcategorySelect('receivableSubcategory',$('receivableCategory').value,mainSubcategory||$('receivableSubcategory')?.value||'')}if($('receivablePaymentCategory')){const old=paymentCategory||$('receivablePaymentCategory').value;$('receivablePaymentCategory').innerHTML=categoryOptionsFor(paymentTreatment==='income'?['income']:['expense','investment'],'Selecciona categoría');$('receivablePaymentCategory').value=[...$('receivablePaymentCategory').options].some(o=>o.value===old)?old:'';fillSubcategorySelect('receivablePaymentSubcategory',$('receivablePaymentCategory').value,paymentSubcategory||$('receivablePaymentSubcategory')?.value||'')}}
function buildInstallments(total,mode,count,startDate){total=+total||0;count=mode==='installments'?Math.max(2,+count||2):1;const cents=Math.round(total*100),base=Math.floor(cents/count),out=[];for(let i=0;i<count;i++){const amount=(i===count-1?cents-base*(count-1):base)/100;out.push({id:uid(),dueDate:i?addMonthsIso(startDate,i):startDate,amount,payments:[]})}return out}
function receivableSplitItemsFromForm(){return [...document.querySelectorAll('#receivableSplitRows .receivableSplitEditRow')].map(row=>({name:(row.querySelector('.receivableSplitName')?.value||'').trim(),amount:+(row.querySelector('.receivableSplitAmount')?.value||0)})).filter(x=>x.name||x.amount>0)}
